{"2790190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Polygon Bit Battle Royale", "steam_appid": 2790190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>BattleVox is Our Next Battle Royale | 🔥 Wishlist Now 🔥</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790190/extras/c6e67f251cc7117dca77611b159b88b3.avif?t=1787702254\" width=1024 height=238 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Polygon Bit Battle Royale</strong> is an <strong>offline-focused Battle Royale</strong> where you can fight up to 50 <strong>smart AI bots</strong> with <strong>no waiting and no matchmaking required</strong>.<br>Jump straight into the action, and progress your character and weapons completely offline, or go online to battle real players and squad up with friends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OFFLINE BATTLE ROYALE (NO WAITING)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play instantly in full, large-scale Battle Royale matches against <strong>intelligent AI bots</strong>.<br>No queue times, no empty lobbies, no connection issues — just parachute in and fight. No need to worry about low CCU or dead servers anymore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a complete Battle Royale experience entirely offline, with no internet required, and progress normally through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790190/extras/f2c285a62a0eea64c51add09e3071e90.poster.avif?t=1787702254\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790190/extras/f2c285a62a0eea64c51add09e3071e90.webm?t=1787702254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ONLINE MULTIPLAYER &amp; SQUADS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to play with others, Polygon Bit also supports <strong>online multiplayer</strong>.<br>Fight real players or team up with friends in <strong>squads of up to 5</strong>.<br>The choice is yours: offline freedom or online competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790190/extras/5d7c12a54099f1d3272100dd93b62cfe.poster.avif?t=1787702254\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790190/extras/5d7c12a54099f1d3272100dd93b62cfe.webm?t=1787702254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SMART BOTS THAT FILL EVERY MATCH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our AI system ensures every match always has 50 combatants. Bots:<br>• Loot, shoot, flank, chase, and hide<br>• Engage each other dynamically<br>• Scale their behavior with difficulty settings<br>• Make offline play feel intense and alive</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With bots filling the action, <strong>the game never feels empty</strong> — whether you're offline or online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790190/extras/b1cb2499c4c83dd0d55eb44a08e99583.poster.avif?t=1787702254\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790190/extras/b1cb2499c4c83dd0d55eb44a08e99583.webm?t=1787702254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FULL CHARACTER CUSTOMIZATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own unique survivor using hundreds of customization options.<br>Mix and match heads, bodies, glasses, masks, colors, and more to craft a style that’s truly yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790190/extras/b318bf78ebd97809f4f5724239224713.poster.avif?t=1787702254\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790190/extras/b318bf78ebd97809f4f5724239224713.webm?t=1787702254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WEAPON SKINS &amp; PROGRESSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and equip a variety of <strong>weapon skins</strong> to personalize your arsenal.<br>Progress at your own pace — whether you play offline or online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790190/extras/375c2c764a92234edc691616f3cd252f.poster.avif?t=1787702254\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790190/extras/375c2c764a92234edc691616f3cd252f.webm?t=1787702254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 50-player full offline Battle Royale mode<br>• Offline Battle Royale with smart and challenging AI bots<br>• Optional 50-player online Battle Royale<br>• Online Squad Battle Royale with up to 5 players<br>• Character customization<br>• Weapon skins and progression<br>• Multiple large-scale maps<br>• Fast, low-poly tactical combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p cl